# DeepSeek V3.2 — findings by Iceman

- Source: DeepSeek AI/DeepSeek-V3.2
- Date: 2026-11-10 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** DeepSeek-V3.2
- **Short description:** DeepSeek-V3.2 is an MIT-licensed 685B/37B-active MoE model (128K context) emphasizing efficient reasoning and agentic tool use, including “thinking inside tool use”.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on Hugging Face (`deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2`, MIT license) and hosted providers. Local metadata lists `deepseek/deepseek-v3.2`, pricing ~$0.28/$0.42 per 1M, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Hugging Face model card/technical report reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed source.
- **IDs:** `DeepSeek-V3.2`, `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2`.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens first-party (163,840 on some providers per local metadata); 65,536 max output.
- **Modalities:** Text input/output (text-only).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Open weights free to self-host (MIT). Hosted ~$0.28/$0.42 per 1M in/out, $0.028 cached (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** MoE transformer, 685B total / 37B active parameters, DeepSeek Sparse Attention (DSA), thinking/non-thinking modes (HF card).

